# Test corpora are compared BYTE for byte, so git must not rewrite their line
# endings on checkout. Without this, every fixture arrives CRLF on Windows
# while the parser under test emits LF, and `jmap-sync --test quote_corpus`
# fails locally while passing on Linux CI ... the worst shape of failure,
# because it looks like a real regression to whoever is on Windows.
jmap-sync/tests/** -text

# Shell scripts must stay LF or they will not execute in a container.
*.sh text eol=lf
